            "observablePerformanceEn": "Infers economic impact from stated data and mechanisms."
          },
          {
            "id": "e2",
            "essentialUnderstandingDe": "Eine historisch-wirtschaftliche Bewertung braucht Grenzen und Gegenargumente; Korrelation genügt nicht zur Alleinursache.",
            "essentialUnderstandingEn": "Historical economic judgment needs limits and counterarguments; correlation does not establish sole causation.",
