              "sourceContextAndLimits": "Original BW BP2016/V2 physical10/printed8 distinguishes Basisfach overview with exemplary depth from Leistungsfach higher modelling/mathematics. Physical42/printed40 3.4.8(4), Leistungsfach only, names dyes among examples of a further selected research substance group. This supplies no universal complete dye course, no choice by an individual and no GK duty for the four authored basic dye targets.",
