              "wholeUnchangedAcquisitionScope": "Actual source lookup of the two stated EFSA primary pages with locator/access record, then substance identity, matched use/exposure and limited health evidence. No completed research, actual approval, toxicology ranking by natural/synthetic origin or dose is fabricated.",
